#
# prima-materia - the Hekhalot and Merkavah transmission
#
# Order of the file: the tradition, then the descent and the gate at which
# fitness is decided, then the capacity this literature states more plainly
# than any other the graph holds - knowledge of the Law obtained without
# study - and last the operative handbook with its numbers and its penalty.
# The instance was registered in traditions/registry-west-asia.ttl and is
# moved here now that passages have been read.
#
# The file is opened under the entrance SPEC section 14 gives priority to.
